# ─── Contact Form Email ────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# SMTP configuration (used by server.js on Railway / any Node host)
# Set these environment variables in your Railway dashboard or .env file.
#
SMTP_HOST=smtp.example.com
SMTP_PORT=587
SMTP_USER=your-smtp-username
SMTP_PASS=your-smtp-password
FROM_EMAIL=hello@sagestoneinc.com

# ─── Cloudflare (only needed when deploying to Cloudflare Pages) ──
# Configure the send_email binding in the Cloudflare dashboard for Pages.
# Ensure Cloudflare Email Routing is enabled for your domain
# in the Cloudflare dashboard under Email → Email Routing.
# FROM_EMAIL is also set in wrangler.toml [vars].
